# GET /health - liveness probe.
#
# Answers only after a MySQL round trip, so it also works as a readiness check.
#
# Run with: npx httpyac send http/health.http --all

@host = http://localhost:3000

###

# @name Health check
# The generic call: no parameters, no body.
GET {{host}}/health

?? status == 200
?? body status == ok

# Example response - 200 OK
#
# {
#   "status": "ok"
# }

###
# -- Other cases --
###

# With MySQL down the same call answers 500:
#
# Example response - 500 Internal Server Error
#
# {
#   "error": {
#     "code": "INTERNAL_ERROR",
#     "message": "Unexpected server error"
#   }
# }
